SEPARATE LICENCE FOR KNOWLEDGE BASE CONTENT
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The contents of the `rulepack/` directory — nutrition thresholds, additive
records, source citations, message text and related curated content — are NOT
covered by the Apache License 2.0.

They are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(CC BY 4.0). See `rulepack/LICENSE`.

A software licence fits a dataset badly. The knowledge base is intended to be
reusable and citable by other projects with attribution, independently of this
application (ADR-0017).

The directory boundary is the licence boundary. Curated content belongs in
`rulepack/`; a rule smuggled into Dart is a licensing inconsistency as well as
an architectural violation.

